bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/daemon-surface.mem:109:She clicks //ledger//. A `lar:act` crosses to the daemon engine. The engine summons `wiki-switch`, and the //ledger// row reads //waking//; the actor wakes and answers. The engine asks `lar:service{kind: "route"}`; the page checks the activation the click carried, answers `ok`, sends `lar:resend` for //ledger//'s story camera, and shows the plate, since this surface holds no last frame of //ledger// yet. The plate reads `ledger · seed · 3 of 7`. The first `lar:surface` key lands; the plate lifts. She copies the order number.
