bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/spirit-handback-face-join-reseal.mem:109:* ''Joinee-side ingestion of `reSealed` into the content plane'': the fix ships the re-sealed ciphertext on the grant and proves the member decrypts it, but the daemon face-join client's absorption of those chunks into the joinee's bag docs (Automerge/residency) is content-plane work outside the keyhive lane — not wired or asserted here.
bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/wiki-layer-ontology.mem:208:''The daemon carries working memory alone'' (operator, 2026-10-20). The face's pins rest in the face's custody and `@persona`; verb summonses and their answers travel on the face's own intent plane, `@intents-<tag>`; the daemon bag beneath keeps only the vessel's own records. The daemon wiki shows the intent plane through a read-only view pane, never as its pipe (<<~ loulou "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/face-intent-plane">> #/the-split).
bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/wiki-layer-ontology.mem:297:The wiki-level crossing earns a ''bag-grain verb pair'', SPARQL Update derived: `CREATE` mints the new coordinate (`CREATE GRAPH` analog), bag-grain `COPY` grants residency for every title with `change-id` preserved under one `transfer-id` family, and registration lands as a `holdings` accession in `@catalog` (the union catalog). Operator ruling: pono web3 models in place early — a first-class mint verb keeps registry, capability gates, and audit ledger aligned with the coordinate-space model before batch-conventions calcify. Routing rides the sovereign-worker rail (verb-tiddler → summons → outcome; admin island executes; orichalcum `admin` on destination + `edit` on `@catalog`). Full law: `residency-model#action-verb-surface`, bag-grain section. Implementation pending in `residency-actions.ts`.
bags/lares/ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/testing-architecture-scout.mem:65:|§4 //"All six duplicate-named test files are welds, not duplicates."// |''Eleven duplicate-named pairs stand today, not six — nine welds, two same-name/unrelated-surfaces, zero true duplicates.'' Welds: `face-join`, `genesis-startup-contract`, `nexus-offering-inspect`, `nexus-publish`, `pronaos-public-artifact`, `wiki-sense-supervision`, `wiki-sensorium-cap`, `wiki-sensorium-consistency`, `worldline-trajectory-source`. Same name, unrelated surfaces: `capture-source` (lararium-node's python-holder session shore vs lares-cli's harvest string-identity dedup) and `key-class` (lararium-mesh's closed vocabulary itself vs lararium-node's `vesselKeyCensus`/vault-carrier integration). |`git ls-files \| grep -E '\.test\.[cm]?[jt]s$' \| xargs -n1 basename \| sort \| uniq -d` (11 names); path per name via `git ls-files \| grep -F "/<name>"`; classification by reading each pair's header |
